sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Service centre
  participant UI as React app
  participant IPFS as IPFS
  participant C as VehicleRegistry
  S->>UI: Search VIN / plate
  UI->>C: getVehicle(vin) (free read)
  C-->>UI: vehicle incl. lastOdometer
  S->>UI: odometer, type, cost, invoice file
  UI->>IPFS: upload invoice
  IPFS-->>UI: CID
  UI->>C: addServiceRecord(vin, km, type, desc, cost, CID)
  alt km >= lastOdometer
    C-->>UI: emit ServiceRecordAdded
  else km < lastOdometer
    C-->>UI: revert OdometerRollback(last, km)
    UI-->>S: "Odometer cannot be lower than the previous reading"
  end
